@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowThickness 1.1
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR

Class Person
Class Preorder
Class FulfilmentDate
Class "<<enumeration>>\nFulfilmentMethod" as FulfilmentMethod {
DELIVERY
COLLECTION
}
Class HandoverNotes
Class Item
Class ItemName
Class Quantity
Class Remark
Class "<<enumeration>>\nItemStatus" as ItemStatus {
PENDING
PREPARED
COMPLETED
}
' style.puml hides members, but an enumeration is clearer with its values
show FulfilmentMethod fields
show ItemStatus fields

Person *--> "0..1" Preorder
Preorder *--> "0..1" FulfilmentDate
Preorder --> "0..1" FulfilmentMethod
Preorder *--> "0..1" HandoverNotes
Preorder *--> "*" Item
Item *--> "1" ItemName
Item *--> "1" Quantity
Item --> "1" ItemStatus
Item *--> "0..1" Remark

FulfilmentDate -[hidden]right-> FulfilmentMethod
FulfilmentMethod -[hidden]right-> HandoverNotes
HandoverNotes -[hidden]right-> Item
ItemName -[hidden]right-> Quantity
Quantity -[hidden]right-> ItemStatus
ItemStatus -[hidden]right-> Remark
@enduml
